WEBVTT

00:08:59.579 --> 00:09:01.650
And, in fact, it didn't
make any difference,

00:09:01.674 --> 00:09:03.699
because I didn't have
any patients anymore.

00:09:03.723 --> 00:09:06.976
So, with the advice of my physician,

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:10.595
I had myself admitted
to the acute care psychiatric unit

00:09:10.619 --> 00:09:12.488
of our university hospital.

00:09:12.512 --> 00:09:15.184
And my colleagues, who had known me
since medical school,

00:09:15.208 --> 00:09:17.371
in that place, said, "Don't worry, Shep.

00:09:17.395 --> 00:09:19.543
Six weeks, you're back
in the operating room.

00:09:19.567 --> 00:09:21.106
Everything's going to be great."

00:09:21.467 --> 00:09:23.922
Well, you know what bovine stercus is?

00:09:24.642 --> 00:09:28.215
That proved to be a lot of bovine stercus.

00:09:28.239 --> 00:09:30.842
(Laughter)